<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light dark">
    <meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light dark">
    <title>Reflekto is pausing — please export your data</title>
    <style>
      * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      body {
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        background: #f4f4f7;
        color: #1a1a2e;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }
      .wrapper       { max-width: 520px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 0 20px 40px; }
      .logo-row      { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px; }
      .logo          { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #1EDD88; letter-spacing: -0.3px; text-decoration: none; }
      .card          { background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid #e4e4e8; box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); }

      .card-accent   { height: 3px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1EDD88 0%, #0fbf6e 100%); }

      .card-body     { padding: 32px 32px 28px; }
      .greeting      { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #1a1a2e; line-height: 1.3; margin-bottom: 10px; letter-spacing: -0.3px; }
      .subtext       { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; color: #555570; margin-bottom: 20px; }
      .subtext:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 28px; }
      .subtext strong { color: #1a1a2e; }

      .notice-block  {
        background: rgba(30, 221, 136, 0.07);
        border-left: 3px solid #1EDD88;
        border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
        padding: 14px 16px;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }
      .notice-label  { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1EDD88; margin-bottom: 5px; }
      .notice-text   { font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #555570; }

      .cta-wrap      { text-align: left; margin-bottom: 8px; }
      .cta           {
        display: inline-block;
        background: #1EDD88;
        color: #0a1a0a;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 700;
        font-size: 15px;
        padding: 13px 28px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        letter-spacing: -0.1px;
      }

      .card-footer   { border-top: 1px solid #e4e4e8; padding: 18px 32px; }
      .footer-text   { font-size: 12px; color: #9090b0; line-height: 1.6; }
      .footer-text a { color: #1EDD88; text-decoration: none; }

      .outer-footer  { text-align: center; margin-top: 24px; font-size: 11px; color: #b0b0c0; }

      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        body { background: #0f0f1a !important; color: #e8e8f0 !important; }
        .card { background: #1a1a2e !important; border-color: #2a2a4a !important; box-shadow: none !important; }
        .greeting { color: #e8e8f0 !important; }
        .subtext { color: #9090b0 !important; }
        .subtext strong { color: #e8e8f0 !important; }
        .notice-block { background: rgba(30, 221, 136, 0.06) !important; }
        .notice-text { color: #c0c0d8 !important; }
        .card-footer { border-top-color: #222240 !important; }
        .footer-text { color: #555570 !important; }
        .outer-footer { color: #3a3a55 !important; }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">

      <div class="logo-row">
        <span class="logo">Reflekto</span>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-accent"></div>

        <div class="card-body">
          <p class="greeting">
            <%= @user.name.present? ? "Hey #{@user.name.split.first}" : "Hey there" %>
          </p>
          <p class="subtext">
            We're pausing Reflekto starting <strong>October 3, 2026</strong>. We don't
            know yet whether this will be temporary or permanent, so to be safe, please
            export your entries before then.
          </p>
          <p class="subtext">
            Your data won't be touched unless you ask us to remove it. If you'd rather
            we delete your entries instead of leaving them dormant, just reply to this
            email and we'll take care of it.
          </p>
          <p class="subtext">
            And if we do come back, we'll make sure there's a way to import your
            exported entries straight back into your journal.
          </p>

          <div class="notice-block">
            <p class="notice-label">Before October 3</p>
            <p class="notice-text">Download a plain-text copy of every entry from every journal, right from your Settings page.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="cta-wrap">
            <%= link_to "Export my entries &rarr;".html_safe, settings_url(anchor: "data"), class: "cta" %>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card-footer">
          <p class="footer-text">
            Thanks for journaling with us.<br>
            &mdash; The Reflekto team
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="outer-footer">Reflekto &middot; reflektoapp.com</p>

    </div>
  </body>
</html>
